      "ruku": 405,
      "hizbQuarter": 187,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4152,
      "text": "He knows the sneaky glances of the eyes and what the hearts conceal.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 40,
        "name": "سُورَةُ غَافِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Ghafir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Forgiver",
        "numberOfAyahs": 85,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 469,
      "ruku": 405,
      "hizbQuarter": 187,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4153,
      "text": "Allah judges with justice, whereas those whom they invoke besides Him cannot judge at all. Indeed, it is Allah Who is the All-Hearing, the All-Seeing.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 40,
        "name": "سُورَةُ غَافِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Ghafir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Forgiver",
        "numberOfAyahs": 85,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 469,
      "ruku": 405,
      "hizbQuarter": 187,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4154,
      "text": "Have they not traveled in the land to see what was the end of those who came before them? They were far superior in strength and left more impressive marks in the land, but Allah seized them for their sins, and they had none to protect them from Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 40,
        "name": "سُورَةُ غَافِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Ghafir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Forgiver",
        "numberOfAyahs": 85,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 469,
      "ruku": 406,
      "hizbQuarter": 188,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4155,
      "text": "That was because their messengers came to them with clear proofs, but they disbelieved; so Allah seized them. He is indeed All-Powerful and Severe in punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 40,
        "name": "سُورَةُ غَافِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Ghafir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Forgiver",
        "numberOfAyahs": 85,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 469,
      "ruku": 406,
      "hizbQuarter": 188,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4156,
      "text": "We sent Moses with Our signs and compelling proof",
      "surah": {
        "number": 40,
        "name": "سُورَةُ غَافِرٍ",
